From a7d7cedfcf4828e83d39831c35aaedce84bc3fec Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kierandrewett <kieran@drewett.dev>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 00:54:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(task): select subagent models by role

Allow explicit per-worker model roles and use native Jev to choose a configured model when no selection is supplied. Prefer Sonnet for uncertain classifications and surface the resolved model.

Verified 162 focused task tests, type checking and a live Jev choice. The selected Haiku worker hit a provider rate limit.
